<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY O/N RATES UNCHANGED END AT 20.50 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY O/N RATES UNCHANGED END AT 20.50 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight rates closed unchanged on Tuesday in light turnover, dealers said.</p>
<p>Overnight rates finished at Monday's closing level of around 20.50 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;There was an offer at the end of 20.75 but I don't believe a deal was done at that level,&quot; said Jozsef Laczi of ING bank.</p>
<p>Dealers said they did not see any market moving factors.</p>
</text>
